//- One row of the entries table. Parameter: entry, a key of the package's exports.
tr
  td
    code {{ entry }}
  if entry == "."
    td
      code render
    td Node, Bun, browsers
    td At request time, to draw a compiled template. It is also the only entry a browser needs to draw stored ASTs.
  else if entry == "./compile"
    td
      code compile
    td Node, Bun, browsers
    td When a template is saved or a site is built: the static analysis that turns source into an AST and diagnostics.
  else if entry == "./node"
    td
      code createFileLoader
    td Node and Bun
    td When compile has to follow include and layout into files on disk. The only entry that touches the file system.
  else if entry == "./registry"
    td
      code components
    td Node, Bun, browsers
    td When a template calls registry components: the table compile checks every call against.
  else
    td
    td
    td
